ds a dreamy, ethereal quality to the scene. The composition and color palette evoke a sense of peace, innocence, and the simple joys of nature."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 1, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [312.2679443359375, 248.2139129638672], "pos": [3491.406494140625, 1740.5902099609375], "widgets_values": ["", "这张照片捕捉了一个年轻的女孩，站在充满活力的阳光草地上，里面充满了各种五颜六色的野花。这个女孩的位置位于图像中，有着长长的波浪棕色头发，使她的肩膀降落在她的肩膀上。她穿着一件简单的无袖白色连衣裙，与周围的花朵的鲜艳色彩形成鲜明对比。她的脸有些模糊，但她热情地微笑，暗示着一种喜悦和满足感。\n\n草地丰富，有黄色，橙色，紫色和白色阴影的花朵，营造出一种生动而开朗的氛围。花朵盛开，高高的绿色茎和精致的花瓣。背景的景色模糊了，山丘和晴朗的蓝天，为图像增添了深度，并强调了环境的自然美景。\n\n这张照片是在明亮的日光下拍摄的，阳光增强了花朵的颜色，并在女孩的脸上散发出柔和的光芒。图像的整体质地柔软，略有模糊，为现场增添了梦幻，空灵的质量。构图和调色板唤起了和平，纯真和自然的简单喜悦感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [2], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [424.88970947265625, 310], "pos": [3426.5810546875, 1362.0098876953125], "widgets_values": ["english", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 3, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [1, 36], "label": "text", "t